Changes are in-memory until you click **Save Bundle**.

## Copying from a bundle

The reverse direction lives on this tab: **Pull from bundle** copies the open bundle's tenants into this saved list - new tenant IDs are added and blank fields on existing entries are filled, but nothing already set here is ever overwritten. Review the result, then Save.</sys:String>

